# Astro templates are deliberately excluded. prettier-plugin-astro re-wraps
# markup when a line exceeds printWidth, and re-wrapping changes rendered
# whitespace: it turned the footer into "Ben Crane . All rights reserved."
# (note the space before the period). htmlWhitespaceSensitivity "strict" does
# not prevent it. A formatter that can silently alter shipped HTML is worse
# than no formatter, so Prettier is scoped to logic and config files, where
# drift causes review noise and reformatting is output-safe.
*.astro
